    description: "WHAT. framework_patterns.resolve_deferred_symbol_refs and the enrichment table beside it key every symbol of every language by name, last write wins, in symbols order (which varies between runs: see the completion-order item).\n\nSEEN. pretix: the UsageContext for route ^locale/set$ carried symbol_ref = the Python view in one base run and javascript:static/pdfjs/pdf.worker.js:...:LocaleSet:class in another. PR #2198 fixed the same defect in linkers/route_handler.py (candidates restricted to the route's host language, total order, qualified name before name) and left this one.\n\nASK. The same rule here. Found during PR 1 of the stable-id plan, 2026-11-15 (PR #2198). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr1/STATUS.md."  # c0f9
